    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d40">

                <pb facs="0149" n="61" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg61"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Egan to Mr.
                            Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-07-07"><hi rendition="#italic">July 7, 1892</hi></date>.
                        (Received August 11.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 320.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg to refer to my No. 319 of 2d instant,
                    inclosing copy of my note addressed to the minister of foreign relations on the
                    subject of the repeated attacks made by a section of the Chilean press upon the
                    honor of Admiral Brown and other officers of the U. S. Navy, and now inclose
                    translation of the reply of the minister thereto.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Patrick Egan.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d40-a1.xml" xpointer="d40-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
